14:["$","p","3",{"className":"wp-block-paragraph","children":"My Dming style focuses a lot on immersion; I like keeping things in-game and adjust themes and styles to fit players’ experiences, especially in campaigns. I had introduced more than a dozen players into the game, and I consider myself a new player friendly DM."}]
15:["$","p","5",{"className":"wp-block-paragraph","children":"When I’m not running games, I often spend my time playing videogames, card games, and creating new exciting adventures, mechanics, maps, and whathaveyou for my players. I’m a big fan of the creative process of bringing a world to life, telling meaningful overarching stories, and creating engaging mechanics. If you are looking for your first adventure or your 100th, I’d love to have you at our table!"}]
